# --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/DialogueTest.lvl
# Dialogue (GAME-8): the kit's Conversation runs Assets/Dialogue/Tests/Gate.dialogue through the
# stock dialogue box (Engine/Assets/UI/Dialogue/Dialogue.rml): a line, a choice clicked in the
# document, a variable filled into a line, a <<event>> for the game, then the box goes away.
wait-log dotnet ready | 7200
wait 10
play
wait-log UI: rebound | 600
wait 10
ui-assert-text #dialogue-speaker | Guard
ui-assert-text #dialogue-text | Halt! Who goes there?
ui-click #dialogue-continue
wait 3
ui-assert-text #dialogue-choice-0 | A friend.
ui-assert-text #dialogue-choice-1 | None of your business.
screenshot .tmp/EditorFlows/DialogueChoice.png
ui-click #dialogue-choice-0
wait 3
ui-assert-text #dialogue-text | Then pass, friend.
ui-click #dialogue-continue
wait 3
ui-assert-text #dialogue-text | Mind the stairs, traveller.
ui-click #dialogue-continue
wait-log Dialogue: event open-gate north | 60
wait 3
ui-assert-text #dialogue-text |
stop
